                            <comment id="14558912" author="mina lee" created="Tue, 26 May 2015 09:22:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please make sure that you are using spark version 1.3.x&lt;br/&gt;
Currently, zeppelin use spark 1.1.1 by default.&lt;br/&gt;
If you want to check spark version, you can run `sc.version` on zeppelin.&lt;br/&gt;
You can build zeppelin with specific spark version via `mvn clean package -DskipTests -Dspark.version=1.3.1 -Pspark-1.3`&lt;br/&gt;
Zeppelin&apos;s default spark version will be changed to 1.3.1 soon.&lt;br/&gt;
Here is the related PR link &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/71&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/71&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14558919" author="ank2508" created="Tue, 26 May 2015 09:32:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hey, I am using spark version 1.3.1.&lt;br/&gt;
Yes, I have done the same thing to build the spark along with hadoop version 2.4.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14611209" author="moon" created="Thu, 2 Jul 2015 00:00:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I can not reproduce the problem. If you still have the problem, please feel free to reopen the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
